# Local CAD models stay untracked — except the small as1 STEP sample the CI
# import smoke checks and the packaged sample-files/ depend on. Use a
# contents glob, not `test_files/`: git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is itself excluded.
test_files/*
!test_files/as1-ug-214.stp
test_figures/
